{"seq":3,"slug":"audio-quality-evaluation","title":"音频质量评估","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-speech-audio/production-audio-systems/audio-quality-evaluation","wordCount":1506,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"音频质量评估\">音频质量评估</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>音频质量评估（Audio Quality Evaluation）是衡量语音和音频处理系统输出质量的系统化方法。它贯穿于 ASR、TTS、语音增强、音源分离等所有音频 AI 系统的开发和优化过程。评估方法分为<strong>主观评估</strong>（人类听感判断）和<strong>客观评估</strong>（算法自动计算），两者各有优势，实际工程中需要结合使用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 主观评估&#10;        MOS[MOS 评分&lt;br&gt;5 分制]&#10;        AB[AB 测试&lt;br&gt;偏好选择]&#10;        MUSHRA[MUSHRA&lt;br&gt;多刺激测试]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 客观评估 - 有参考&#10;        PESQ[PESQ&lt;br&gt;语音质量]&#10;        POLQA[POLQA&lt;br&gt;下一代 PESQ]&#10;        SISDR[SI-SDR&lt;br&gt;信号失真比]&#10;        STOI[STOI&lt;br&gt;可懂度]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 客观评估 - 无参考&#10;        DNSMOS[DNSMOS&lt;br&gt;DNN 预测 MOS]&#10;        UTMOS[UTMOS&lt;br&gt;TTS MOS 预测]&#10;        NISQA[NISQA&lt;br&gt;非侵入式质量]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph 主观评估\n        MOS[MOS 评分&lt;br&gt;5 分制]\n        AB[AB 测试&lt;br&gt;偏好选择]\n        MUSHRA[MUSHRA&lt;br&gt;多刺激测试]\n    end\n    subgraph 客观评估 - 有参考\n        PESQ[PESQ&lt;br&gt;语音质量]\n        POLQA[POLQA&lt;br&gt;下一代 PESQ]\n        SISDR[SI-SDR&lt;br&gt;信号失真比]\n        STOI[STOI&lt;br&gt;可懂度]\n    end\n    subgraph 客观评估 - 无参考\n        DNSMOS[DNSMOS&lt;br&gt;DNN 预测 MOS]\n        UTMOS[UTMOS&lt;br&gt;TTS MOS 预测]\n        NISQA[NISQA&lt;br&gt;非侵入式质量]\n    end</pre><p>主观与客观评估方法的对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>评估类型</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主观 MOS</td>\n<td>金标准，直接反映人类感知</td>\n<td>耗时、昂贵、不可复现</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>最终产品评估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有参考客观</td>\n<td>可复现、自动化</td>\n<td>需要干净参考信号</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>增强/分离系统评估</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无参考客观</td>\n<td>不需要参考、自动化</td>\n<td>与主观评分相关性有限</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>大规模自动筛选</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"主观评估方法\">主观评估方法</h2><p>主观评估是音频质量的金标准，因为最终用户是人。</p>\n<p><strong>MOS（Mean Opinion Score）</strong> 是最广泛使用的主观评估方法。听者对音频质量在 1-5 分之间打分，取所有评分的均值。ITU-T P.800 标准定义了 MOS 测试的详细流程：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>MOS 分值</th>\n<th>质量描述</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>优秀（Excellent）</td>\n<td>无可感知失真</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>良好（Good）</td>\n<td>可感知但不恼人的失真</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>一般（Fair）</td>\n<td>轻微恼人的失真</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>差（Poor）</td>\n<td>恼人的失真</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>很差（Bad）</td>\n<td>非常恼人的失真</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>CMOS（Comparative MOS）</strong> 用于比较两个系统的输出。听者听两段音频后在 -3 到 +3 之间评分（-3: 系统 B 远好于 A，+3: 系统 A 远好于 B）。CMOS 比绝对 MOS 更敏感，能检测出 0.1-0.2 分的微小差异。</p>\n<p><strong>MUSHRA（Multi-Stimulus with Hidden Reference and Anchor）</strong> 同时展示多个系统的输出（含隐藏的参考信号和低锚点），听者在 0-100 分之间评价每个系统。适合比较多个系统的相对质量。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import numpy as np&#10;from scipy import stats&#10;&#10;def analyze_mos(scores: dict[str, list[float]]) -&gt; dict:&#10;    results = {}&#10;    for system, system_scores in scores.items():&#10;        n = len(system_scores)&#10;        mean = np.mean(system_scores)&#10;        ci95 = stats.t.ppf(0.975, n - 1) * np.std(system_scores) / np.sqrt(n)&#10;        results[system] = {&#10;            &quot;mean_mos&quot;: round(mean, 2),&#10;            &quot;ci_95&quot;: round(ci95, 2),&#10;            &quot;range&quot;: f&quot;{round(mean - ci95, 2)} - {round(mean + ci95, 2)}&quot;,&#10;            &quot;n_ratings&quot;: n,&#10;        }&#10;    return results\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scipy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stats</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> analyze_mos</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(scores: dict[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, list[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]]) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    results </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> system, system_scores </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> scores.items():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(system_scores)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        mean </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.mean(system_scores)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ci95 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stats.t.ppf(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.975</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, n </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.std(system_scores) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.sqrt(n)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        results[system] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"mean_mos\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mean, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"ci_95\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ci95, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"range\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mean </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ci95, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> - </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mean </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ci95, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"n_ratings\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: n,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> results</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>MOS 测试的最佳实践</strong>：每个系统至少收集 20-30 个评分（不同听者）；使用耳机而非扬声器；评分前播放校准样本；随机化播放顺序；排除注意力不集中的评分者（通过隐藏参考检测）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"有参考客观指标\">有参考客观指标</h2><p>有参考（Intrusive）指标需要干净的参考信号，通过比较参考和处理后信号的差异来量化质量。</p>\n<p><strong>PESQ（Perceptual Evaluation of Speech Quality）</strong> 是 ITU-T P.862 标准，模拟人耳的感知模型计算语音质量分数（-0.5 到 4.5）。它对频谱失真、时间偏移和噪声残留敏感，是语音增强领域最常用的客观指标：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from pesq import pesq&#10;import librosa&#10;&#10;ref, sr = librosa.load(&quot;clean.wav&quot;, sr=16000)&#10;deg, _ = librosa.load(&quot;enhanced.wav&quot;, sr=16000)&#10;&#10;min_len = min(len(ref), len(deg))&#10;ref, deg = ref[:min_len], deg[:min_len]&#10;&#10;score_wb = pesq(sr, ref, deg, &quot;wb&quot;)&#10;score_nb = pesq(sr, ref, deg, &quot;nb&quot;)&#10;&#10;print(f&quot;PESQ (宽带): {score_wb:.3f}&quot;)&#10;print(f&quot;PESQ (窄带): {score_nb:.3f}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pesq </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pesq</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> librosa</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ref, sr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> librosa.load(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"clean.wav\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">deg, _ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> librosa.load(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"enhanced.wav\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">min_len </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ref), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(deg))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ref, deg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ref[:min_len], deg[:min_len]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">score_wb </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pesq(sr, ref, deg, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"wb\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">score_nb </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pesq(sr, ref, deg, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"nb\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PESQ (宽带): </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">score_wb</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.3f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PESQ (窄带): </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">score_nb</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.3f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>SI-SDR（Scale-Invariant Signal-to-Distortion Ratio）</strong> 衡量信号与干扰的比值，对幅度缩放不敏感。是语音分离和增强领域的标准指标：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>范围</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>PESQ</td>\n<td>-0.5 ~ 4.5</td>\n<td>感知语音质量</td>\n<td>与 MOS 高相关</td>\n<td>语音增强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>STOI</td>\n<td>0 ~ 1</td>\n<td>短时客观可懂度</td>\n<td>预测可懂度</td>\n<td>增强/助听器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SI-SDR</td>\n<td>-∞ ~ +∞ dB</td>\n<td>尺度不变信号比</td>\n<td>不受增益影响</td>\n<td>语音分离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SDR</td>\n<td>-∞ ~ +∞ dB</td>\n<td>信号失真比</td>\n<td>BSS 标准指标</td>\n<td>音源分离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ViSQOL</td>\n<td>1 ~ 5</td>\n<td>虚拟语音质量</td>\n<td>适用音频编码</td>\n<td>编码质量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>POLQA（Perceptual Objective Listening Quality Analysis）</strong> 是 PESQ 的下一代标准（ITU-T P.863），支持超宽带和全带音频评估，对现代通信系统（VoIP、HD Voice）的评估更准确。</p>\n<h2 id=\"无参考客观指标\">无参考客观指标</h2><p>无参考（Non-Intrusive）指标不需要干净参考信号，通过训练的 DNN 模型直接从处理后的音频预测质量分数。</p>\n<p><strong>DNSMOS（Deep Noise Suppression MOS）</strong> 是微软为 DNS Challenge 开发的自动 MOS 预测模型。输入含噪/增强后的音频，输出三个维度的 MOS 预测：整体质量（OVRL）、语音质量（SIG）和背景质量（BAK）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import onnxruntime as ort&#10;import librosa&#10;import numpy as np&#10;&#10;class DNSMOS:&#10;    def __init__(self, model_path: str):&#10;        self.session = ort.InferenceSession(model_path)&#10;&#10;    def predict(self, audio_path: str) -&gt; dict:&#10;        audio, sr = librosa.load(audio_path, sr=16000)&#10;        if len(audio) &lt; sr:&#10;            audio = np.pad(audio, (0, sr - len(audio)))&#10;&#10;        input_features = self._extract_features(audio, sr)&#10;        scores = self.session.run(None, {&quot;input&quot;: input_features})&#10;&#10;        return {&#10;            &quot;ovrl_mos&quot;: float(scores[0][0][0]),&#10;            &quot;sig_mos&quot;: float(scores[0][0][1]),&#10;            &quot;bak_mos&quot;: float(scores[0][0][2]),&#10;        }&#10;&#10;    def _extract_features(self, audio: np.ndarray, sr: int) -&gt; np.ndarray:&#10;        mel = librosa.feature.melspectrogram(y=audio, sr=sr, n_mels=120)&#10;        log_mel = librosa.power_to_db(mel).T&#10;        return log_mel[np.newaxis, :, :].astype(np.float32)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> onnxruntime </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ort</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> librosa</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> numpy </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DNSMOS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, model_path: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.session </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ort.InferenceSession(model_path)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> predict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, audio_path: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        audio, sr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> librosa.load(audio_path, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(audio) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sr:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            audio </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> np.pad(audio, (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, sr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(audio)))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        input_features </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">._extract_features(audio, sr)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        scores </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.session.run(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"input\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: input_features})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"ovrl_mos\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(scores[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"sig_mos\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(scores[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            \"bak_mos\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(scores[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> _extract_features</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, audio: np.ndarray, sr: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> np.ndarray:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        mel </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> librosa.feature.melspectrogram(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">y</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">audio, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">sr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sr, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n_mels</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">120</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        log_mel </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> librosa.power_to_db(mel).T</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> log_mel[np.newaxis, :, :].astype(np.float32)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>UTMOS（UTokyo MOS prediction system）</strong> 专为 TTS 评估设计，使用 wav2vec 2.0 特征 + 听者建模（Listener Modeling）预测 MOS 分数。在 VoiceMOS Challenge 2022 中获得第一名。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph UTMOS 架构&#10;        A[合成语音] --&gt; W[wav2vec 2.0&lt;br&gt;特征提取]&#10;        W --&gt; P[加权池化]&#10;        L[听者 ID] --&gt; LE[听者嵌入]&#10;        P --&gt; F[融合层]&#10;        LE --&gt; F&#10;        F --&gt; MOS[MOS 预测&lt;br&gt;1-5 分]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph UTMOS 架构\n        A[合成语音] --&gt; W[wav2vec 2.0&lt;br&gt;特征提取]\n        W --&gt; P[加权池化]\n        L[听者 ID] --&gt; LE[听者嵌入]\n        P --&gt; F[融合层]\n        LE --&gt; F\n        F --&gt; MOS[MOS 预测&lt;br&gt;1-5 分]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>无参考模型</th>\n<th>训练数据</th>\n<th>评估维度</th>\n<th>与人类 MOS 相关性</th>\n<th>开源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>DNSMOS</td>\n<td>DNS Challenge</td>\n<td>OVRL/SIG/BAK</td>\n<td>r=0.94</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UTMOS</td>\n<td>VoiceMOS Challenge</td>\n<td>整体 MOS</td>\n<td>r=0.93</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NISQA</td>\n<td>多数据集</td>\n<td>MOS + 4 维度</td>\n<td>r=0.90</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SpeechLMScore</td>\n<td>LibriTTS</td>\n<td>整体 MOS</td>\n<td>r=0.88</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"tts-专项评估\">TTS 专项评估</h2><p>TTS 系统的评估除了音质外，还需要关注内容准确性、说话人相似度和韵律自然度。</p>\n<p><strong>内容准确性</strong>通过 ASR 系统对合成语音进行转录，计算转录文本与原始文本之间的 CER（Character Error Rate）或 WER。高质量 TTS 系统的 CER 应低于 2%。</p>\n<p><strong>说话人相似度（Speaker Similarity）</strong> 评估语音克隆系统的音色保真度。使用预训练的说话人验证模型（如 ECAPA-TDNN）分别提取参考语音和合成语音的嵌入，计算余弦相似度。</p>\n<p><strong>韵律评估</strong>关注合成语音的节奏、重音和语调。客观指标包括 F0 相关系数、时长误差和能量对比。主观评估通常使用 CMOS 比较两个系统的韵律自然度。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>评估维度</th>\n<th>客观指标</th>\n<th>主观方法</th>\n<th>良好阈值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>音质</td>\n<td>PESQ, UTMOS</td>\n<td>MOS</td>\n<td>MOS &gt; 4.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内容准确性</td>\n<td>CER, WER</td>\n<td>可懂度 MOS</td>\n<td>CER &lt; 2%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>说话人相似度</td>\n<td>余弦相似度</td>\n<td>SMOS</td>\n<td>cos_sim &gt; 0.85</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>韵律自然度</td>\n<td>F0 相关系数</td>\n<td>CMOS</td>\n<td>CMOS &gt; 0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>情感表达</td>\n<td>SER 准确率</td>\n<td>情感 MOS</td>\n<td>准确率 &gt; 70%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>音频质量评估分为主观（MOS、CMOS、MUSHRA）和客观（有参考 PESQ/SI-SDR、无参考 DNSMOS/UTMOS）两大类</li>\n<li>MOS 是金标准但成本高，实际开发中用客观指标快速迭代，关键节点做主观评估</li>\n<li>PESQ 是语音增强领域最常用的有参考指标，与主观 MOS 的相关性达到 r=0.93</li>\n<li>DNSMOS 和 UTMOS 是最强的无参考 MOS 预测模型，分别针对增强和 TTS 场景优化</li>\n<li>TTS 评估需要多维度覆盖：音质（MOS）+ 准确性（CER）+ 说话人相似度（cos_sim）+ 韵律自然度（CMOS）</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"音频质量评估","id":"音频质量评估"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"主观评估方法","id":"主观评估方法"},{"level":2,"text":"有参考客观指标","id":"有参考客观指标"},{"level":2,"text":"无参考客观指标","id":"无参考客观指标"},{"level":2,"text":"TTS 专项评估","id":"tts-专项评估"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"实时音频处理流水线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-speech-audio/production-audio-systems/real-time-audio-pipeline"},"next":null}